{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Fred Johnson's: Mech Simulator</i>, you pilot a powerful mech on the world of Blue Mirage IV. After your freighter is shot down while responding to a distress beacon, you and your mercenary crew must scavenge supplies, fortify a beachside camp, and explore a mysterious island filled with ancient defenses, hostile forces, and the remnants of a lost human settlement. Engage in  battles, solve environmental puzzles, and uncover the secrets of this alien world as you fight to repair your ship and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch out for enemy pirates and looters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278130/extras/combatgif_1_600.gif?t=1744996293\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Important buildings can be destroyed with targeted firepower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278130/extras/Dest_Gif_1_800.gif?t=1744996293\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3278130?t=1744996293","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744996293","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278130/679b361fe318314c0142dd184520b841fde923b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744996293","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278130/679b361fe318314c0142dd184520b841fde923b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744996293","categories":[{"description":"Single-